{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水火", "id": "水火"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.439444275711243, "source": "心", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.49353412665592966, "source": "心", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.8989992347640942, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0531499145913523, "source": "心", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.151762203259462, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.4586150226995167, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.5423242908253617, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.5276078941864681, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5831462853456169, "source": "義", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.2762934659055623, "source": "義", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.6817585740137264, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.122142786078304, "source": "義", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 0.7166776779701394, "source": "民", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 1.4098248585300845, "source": "民", "target": "水火"}, {"weight": 0.5625269981428811, "source": "民", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.3112125698619751, "source": "民", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 0.7166776779701394, "source": "民", "target": "物"}, {"weight": 1.4098248585300845, "source": "求", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.66258782